==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|са̑м}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/sâmo/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|са|мо|lang=sh}}

===Particle===
{{sh-adverb|head=са̏мо|c|sȁmo}}

# {{lb|sh|denoting exclusivity}} [[only]], not more than, nothing else
#: {{ux|sh|само разговарају|t=they are just talking|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|она само учи|t=she does nothing but study|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|не само да је л(иј)епа, него је и паметна|t=she's not only pretty, but she is also smart|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|само један|t=only one|inline=1}}
# {{non-gloss definition|connecting previously spoken text with what follows}}
#: {{ux|sh|само, ипак сам забринут|t=it's just that, I'm a bit concerned|inline=1}}
# [[just]]
#: {{ux|sh|само корак до пропасти|t=just a step away from disaster|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|чекај само|t=just wait|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|зашто ли је само назвао?|t=just why did he call (her)?|inline=1}}
# [[simply]], [[uninterruptedly]], out of its own
#: {{ux|sh|с крова се само циједи|t=it's simply trickling from the root|inline=1}}
# [[merely]], [[solely]]
#: {{ux|sh|улазница стоји само пет куна|t=the ticket costs merely five kunas|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|denoting encouragement}} [[just]]
#: {{ux|sh|наставите само тако!|t=just keeping doing it like that!|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|often ironically}} [[just]]
#: {{ux|sh|само реци, па ћеш видјети|t=just say it, and you'll see|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|to emphasize a prohibition, or something which the interlocutor doesn't want to hear}}
#: {{ux|sh|немој ми само рећи да све то ниси прије знао|t=don't just tell me you didn't know about it beforehand|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|to emphasize wonderment}} [[how on earth]], [[how the hell]]
#: {{ux|sh|како ти само пада на памет тако што|t=how on earth did that occur to you|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|denoting a desire}} [[just]]
#: {{ux|sh|кад би само дошао!|t=if only you came!|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|denoting a condition to execute or allow an action}} [[just]]]
#: {{ux|sh|играј се, само ме пусти на миру!|t=keep playing, just leave me alone!|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|to emphasize wonderment in interrogative clauses}} [[how on earth]], just how
#: {{ux|sh|како је само сазнао?|t=how on earth did he find out?|inline=1}}
# {{non-gloss definition|idiomatic and figurative meanings}}
#: {{ux|sh|(е) да је само...|t=if only|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|да само знаш (чујеш, видиш)|t=if only you knew (heard, saw)|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|само мало|t=just a little|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|само нам је то требало|t=that is all we needed|inline=1}}

===Conjunction===
{{sh-conjunction|head=са̏мо|c|sȁmo}}

# {{lb|sh|denoting opposition or exclusion}} [[just]], [[but]], [[only]]
#: {{ux|sh|што волови мучу, само нек кола не шкрипе||inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|дат ћу/даћу вам све, само без свађе!|t=I'll will get you everything, just don't get into a fight about it!|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|ова хаљина је л(иј)епа, само је скупа|t=this dress is very nice, but it's too expensive|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|denoting limited intention}} [[only]] to, [[merely]] to
#: {{ux|sh|говорим само да говорим|t=|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|denoting an assumption of opposite outcome}} [[if only]]
#: {{ux|sh|ти учиш, само да не буде узалуд|t=you're studying, if only it were not in vain|inline=1}}
# {{non-gloss definition|idiomatic and figurative meanings}}
#: {{ux|sh|није само|t=|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|није то само тако/не може то само тако|t=|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|само што|t=|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|само што не|t=|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|само што нисам/само што није|t=|inline=1}}

